# Organizations / personal

- An account is either personal workspace or a member of organizations (or both). Personal is not a fake org unless the schema truly needs one document — prefer an explicit `workspaceKind`.
- Org data (projects, jobs, audit) must not leak across org boundaries.
- Membership roles: owner, admin, member. Only owner/admin manage LLM routing for that org if org-scoped models exist.
- User deletion from an org ≠ platform user deletion. Document both in [docs/organizations.md](docs/organizations.md).
- Generated project files inherit the org/personal owner of the Cherry project record.
